# Start: a system or game list, no menu open. End: the CLOUD hub, focus on
# BACK UP TO THE CLOUD.
# START opens MAIN MENU on GAME SETTINGS (its first row; START there again
# would close it). GAME SETTINGS opens on its first row; up lands on BACK,
# then wraps to the last row (PER SYSTEM ADVANCED CONFIGURATION), then
# MANAGE CLOUD STORAGE, the last row of the CLOUD SETTINGS group.
key ret
wait 2
key x
wait 2
key up
wait 1
key up
wait 1
key up
wait 1
key x
wait 2
shot cloud-hub
